WEBVTT

00:00:00.058 --> 00:00:03.135
Before implementation, list what must exist before

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:04.539
something else can be completed.

00:00:04.865 --> 00:00:08.243
The view depends on an agreed record format; tests depend

00:00:08.301 --> 00:00:09.822
on defined expected behavior.

00:00:10.426 --> 00:00:13.514
Workers may draft a view and validation logic in parallel

00:00:13.665 --> 00:00:16.637
after the shared format is agreed, but they should not

00:00:16.695 --> 00:00:18.634
edit the same files without coordination.

00:00:19.017 --> 00:00:21.304
The conductor collects each result and checks the

00:00:21.351 --> 00:00:22.349
integrated behavior.

00:00:22.732 --> 00:00:25.124
This is how parallel work saves time without turning

00:00:25.205 --> 00:00:27.237
shared interfaces into a guessing game.
